    "abstract": "Installs the complete RP-AXE 'perfect environment' mod set. Import into a clean CKAN instance ('Install from .ckan file'), then add RP-AXE itself (junction/zip). Mirrors RP-AXE.netkan depends; regenerated from the live test-instance registry.",
